[
  {
    tag: "game",
    schema: 0.1,
    title: _("Council of Hard Choices"),
    children: [
      {
        tag: "side",
        id: 1,
        controller: "human",
        gold: 0,
        leader: "Kalenz",
      },
      {
        tag: "map",
        id: "scenario_08_Council_of_Hard_Choices",
        file: "legend-of-wesmere-08.generated.map",
      },
      {
        tag: "unit",
        id: "Kalenz",
        type: "Elvish Captain",
        side: 1,
        x: 0,
        y: 0,
        name: _("Kalenz"),
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "carryover_5",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "carryover_percentage",
            value: 40,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_6",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/dionli.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Kalenz, you have won a great victory! Wesmere is safe. But... for what cause have you invited a dwarf to the elvish council? This is most unusual!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_7",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/characters/kalenz.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ My lords, this is Olurf. He and his dwarves have fought by our side and have well earned a place in this meeting. The war that comes upon us must be met by all in Wesnoth; elves, dwarves and humans."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_8",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/characters/lord.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Leave the humans out of this. King Haldric has broken the treaty we signed with him eighteen years ago, and has sent back all our emissaries. When he arrived on our shore he was very humble, but now his arrogance knows no bounds. He believes the orcs will not dare to fight him."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_9",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/characters/kalenz.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ My lords, the orcs have been pushed out of Wesmere, but they are far from defeated. We must take the fight to them, recover our lost lands and smash their great horde beyond possibility that it will threaten us again."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_10",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/characters/legmir.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Too many elves have died already. To take the war to the orcs, we would have to risk all our remaining fighters on one throw. And we are not as skilled in fighting outside our forests. We have already shown the orcs that attacking us is folly; the prudent course would be to rebuild our strength."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_11",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/characters/landar.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Those of us who follow Kalenz have shown it can be done. We have been fighting ever since we were forced out of our home country, in all kinds of lands. And, we are willing to die in order to defeat foul orcs!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_12",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/dionli.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Our answer is still no. Prepare our defenses as best you can, but do not renew offensive war. This is the Council’s decision."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_13",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("After leaving the Council, our friends talked in private..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_14",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/characters/kalenz.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Perhaps you were wiser than I, Landar. Had we divided our forces, we would not be bound to inaction now."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_15",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/characters/landar.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ And our home? How can we free Lintanir without taking the war to the orcs?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_16",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/characters/cleodil.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ I too am troubled by the Council’s passivity. But it was not our decision to make."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_17",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/characters/kalenz.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ This is madness! The orcs will but regain their strength and attack again, if we give them the time! We must have some other sort of help. Olurf, can we perhaps make a war-pact with the dwarves?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_18",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/characters/olurf.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ I dinna’ think it can be, Kalenz. My people are too suspicious of you elves. But it may be there is something else we can do. I ha’ heard tale of a powerful mage in the mountains who helped our people before. Maybe he will aid us again."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_19",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/characters/kalenz.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ And where do we find this mage, if he exists?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_20",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/characters/olurf.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ It willna’ be easy. He lives in the mountains of Thoria and he never helps anyone for free. Thoria is very dangerous, especially for elves. Even dwarves and trolls dinna’ go there lightly."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_21",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/characters/kalenz.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ I think the orcs will be in no position to attack us for some time. Maybe we should go see this mage. Olurf, can you take us there?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_22",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/characters/olurf.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ I think I can. But dangerous this will be!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_23",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/characters/kalenz.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Very well. We shall leave our best troops and gold here in case the orcs attack Wesmere again."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "loyal_24",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            units: "Kalenz",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "clock_25",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "turn_limit",
            value: 1,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "objectives",
        side: 1,
        victory: _(""),
        defeat: _(""),
        children: [
          {
            tag: "defeat",
            condition: "hook",
            hook: "predicate:turn_limit",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
